Restaurant menu prices are coming back down to Earth, a new State of Local Commerce study published by DoorDash says. According to the report, the delivery app’s Restaurant Price Index shows that menu price inflation started off 2024 at nearly 6% and steadied by Q2 2025. By September 2025, year-over-year inflation had slowed to 3.2%.&nbsp;

